<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand notes average yield 10.16 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand notes average yield 10.16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand announced on Friday the following result of its weekly notes auction:</p>
<p>   MATURITY  TENDER AMT   ALLOTED AMT    AVG YIELD    RANGE</p>
<p>		 (MLNS BAHT)  (MLNS BAHT)</p>
<p>    28 days    4,710	   2,000	  10.16    10.00-10.46</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
